    },
    {
      "moment_id": 105,
      "subtitle_id": 1470,
      "timestamp_start": "00:56:19,410",
      "timestamp_end": "00:56:21,010",
      "text": "That evening, Marcus's phone rang."
    },
    {
      "moment_id": 106,
      "subtitle_id": 1485,
      "timestamp_start": "00:56:54,110",
      "timestamp_end": "00:56:54,990",
      "text": "And she's clear."
    },
    {
      "moment_id": 107,
      "subtitle_id": 1499,
      "timestamp_start": "00:57:29,250",
      "timestamp_end": "00:57:31,170",
      "text": "He walked into Edna's room quietly."
    },
    {
      "moment_id": 108,
      "subtitle_id": 1513,
      "timestamp_start": "00:58:00,550",
      "timestamp_end": "00:58:02,150",
      "text": "Edna's voice was soft but sure."
    },
    {
      "moment_id": 109,
      "subtitle_id": 1527,
      "timestamp_start": "00:58:25,990",
      "timestamp_end": "00:58:26,810",
      "text": "And she told him."
    },
    {
      "moment_id": 110,
      "subtitle_id": 1541,
      "timestamp_start": "00:58:56,130",
      "timestamp_end": "00:58:57,610",
      "text": "did not want to be the reason he"
    },
    {
      "moment_id": 111,
      "subtitle_id": 1555,
      "timestamp_start": "00:59:23,670",
      "timestamp_end": "00:59:25,470",
      "text": "Always knew how to arrive at the right"
    },
    {
      "moment_id": 112,
      "subtitle_id": 1569,
      "timestamp_start": "00:59:50,970",
      "timestamp_end": "00:59:51,510",
      "text": "Marcus said."
    },
    {
      "moment_id": 113,
      "subtitle_id": 1583,
      "timestamp_start": "01:00:18,110",
      "timestamp_end": "01:00:19,970",
      "text": "Keep Lily close, he said."
    },
    {
      "moment_id": 114,
      "subtitle_id": 1598,
      "timestamp_start": "01:00:54,630",
      "timestamp_end": "01:00:58,230",
      "text": "care physician, a semi-retired family doctor named"
    },
    {
      "moment_id": 115,
      "subtitle_id": 1612,
      "timestamp_start": "01:01:25,770",
      "timestamp_end": "01:01:27,650",
      "text": "I don't trust it to stay safe at"
    },
    {
      "moment_id": 116,
      "subtitle_id": 1626,
      "timestamp_start": "01:01:53,430",
      "timestamp_end": "01:01:55,610",
      "text": "the end, as if the effort of writing"
    },
    {
      "moment_id": 117,
      "subtitle_id": 1640,
      "timestamp_start": "01:02:24,210",
      "timestamp_end": "01:02:25,770",
      "text": "She has always seen me clearly."
    },
    {
      "moment_id": 118,
      "subtitle_id": 1654,
      "timestamp_start": "01:02:59,590",
      "timestamp_end": "01:03:01,310",
      "text": "about an old woman who had written those"
    },
    {
      "moment_id": 119,
      "subtitle_id": 1668,
      "timestamp_start": "01:03:34,930",
      "timestamp_end": "01:03:36,850",
      "text": "But Raymond has gone silent again."
    },
    {
      "moment_id": 120,
      "subtitle_id": 1682,
      "timestamp_start": "01:04:05,890",
      "timestamp_end": "01:04:06,650",
      "text": "Tomorrow morning."
    },
    {
      "moment_id": 121,
      "subtitle_id": 1697,
      "timestamp_start": "01:04:41,230",
      "timestamp_end": "01:04:42,650",
      "text": "One man left to reach."
    },
    {
      "moment_id": 122,
      "subtitle_id": 1711,
      "timestamp_start": "01:05:11,630",
      "timestamp_end": "01:05:12,790",
      "text": "from the corner post."
    },
    {
      "moment_id": 123,
      "subtitle_id": 1725,
      "timestamp_start": "01:05:39,190",
      "timestamp_end": "01:05:40,570",
      "text": "They sat at the kitchen table."
    },
    {
      "moment_id": 124,
      "subtitle_id": 1739,
      "timestamp_start": "01:06:11,110",
      "timestamp_end": "01:06:11,610",
      "text": "I know."
    },
    {
      "moment_id": 125,
      "subtitle_id": 1753,
      "timestamp_start": "01:06:36,030",
      "timestamp_end": "01:06:36,850",
      "text": "Honest and complete."
    },
    {
      "moment_id": 126,
      "subtitle_id": 1767,
      "timestamp_start": "01:07:02,130",
      "timestamp_end": "01:07:04,070",
      "text": "had shown in that consultation room."
    },
    {
      "moment_id": 127,
      "subtitle_id": 1781,
      "timestamp_start": "01:07:30,710",
      "timestamp_end": "01:07:32,330",
      "text": "Raymond said without turning around."
    },
    {
      "moment_id": 128,
      "subtitle_id": 1795,
      "timestamp_start": "01:07:52,930",
      "timestamp_end": "01:07:53,270",
      "text": "You do."
    },
    {
      "moment_id": 129,
      "subtitle_id": 1810,
      "timestamp_start": "01:08:20,109",
      "timestamp_end": "01:08:20,970",
      "text": "The truth finally."
    },
    {
      "moment_id": 130,
      "subtitle_id": 1824,
      "timestamp_start": "01:08:49,410",
      "timestamp_end": "01:08:50,990",
      "text": "He had also found something."
    },
    {
      "moment_id": 131,
      "subtitle_id": 1838,
      "timestamp_start": "01:09:16,710",
      "timestamp_end": "01:09:18,290",
      "text": "Not peaceful exactly."
    },
    {
      "moment_id": 132,
      "subtitle_id": 1852,
      "timestamp_start": "01:09:45,250",
      "timestamp_end": "01:09:47,210",
      "text": "With the calm authority of someone who had"
    },
    {
      "moment_id": 133,
      "subtitle_id": 1866,
      "timestamp_start": "01:10:09,330",
      "timestamp_end": "01:10:10,850",
      "text": "had been the rules all along."
    },
    {
      "moment_id": 134,
      "subtitle_id": 1880,
      "timestamp_start": "01:10:35,210",
      "timestamp_end": "01:10:36,170",
      "text": "That he would be there."
    },
    {
      "moment_id": 135,
      "subtitle_id": 1894,
      "timestamp_start": "01:11:05,370",
      "timestamp_end": "01:11:07,170",
      "text": "Marcus said I know."
    },
    {
      "moment_id": 136,
      "subtitle_id": 1909,
      "timestamp_start": "01:11:40,830",
      "timestamp_end": "01:11:42,850",
      "text": "cards without particular ceremony."
    },
    {
      "moment_id": 137,
      "subtitle_id": 1923,
      "timestamp_start": "01:12:11,650",
      "timestamp_end": "01:12:12,090",
      "text": "moment."
    },
    {
      "moment_id": 138,
      "subtitle_id": 1937,
      "timestamp_start": "01:12:43,150",
      "timestamp_end": "01:12:46,210",
      "text": "old with silver-rimmed glasses and the unhurried"
    },
    {
      "moment_id": 139,
      "subtitle_id": 1951,
      "timestamp_start": "01:13:15,870",
      "timestamp_end": "01:13:16,570",
      "text": "Patricia went first."
    },
    {
      "moment_id": 140,
      "subtitle_id": 1965,
      "timestamp_start": "01:13:48,430",
      "timestamp_end": "01:13:51,530",
      "text": "of her absences documented across years of medical"
    },
    {
      "moment_id": 141,
      "subtitle_id": 1979,
      "timestamp_start": "01:14:24,730",
      "timestamp_end": "01:14:25,630",
      "text": "Raymond spoke next."
    },
    {
      "moment_id": 142,
      "subtitle_id": 1993,
      "timestamp_start": "01:14:56,670",
      "timestamp_end": "01:14:58,330",
      "text": "truth about a woman who had spent her"
    },
    {
      "moment_id": 143,
      "subtitle_id": 2007,
      "timestamp_start": "01:15:26,230",
      "timestamp_end": "01:15:29,250",
      "text": "ago, never submitted, written in her own hand"
    },
    {
      "moment_id": 144,
      "subtitle_id": 2022,
      "timestamp_start": "01:16:00,890",
      "timestamp_end": "01:16:02,950",
      "text": "Just a woman sitting very still in a"
    },
    {
      "moment_id": 145,
      "subtitle_id": 2036,
      "timestamp_start": "01:16:35,470",
      "timestamp_end": "01:16:37,290",
      "text": "Raymond's breath left him all at once."
    },
    {
      "moment_id": 146,
      "subtitle_id": 2050,
      "timestamp_start": "01:17:04,530",
      "timestamp_end": "01:17:05,990",
      "text": "She didn't say anything cruel."
    },
    {
      "moment_id": 147,
      "subtitle_id": 2064,
      "timestamp_start": "01:17:34,050",
      "timestamp_end": "01:17:36,150",
      "text": "for weeks by a child who hadn't known"
    },
    {
      "moment_id": 148,
      "subtitle_id": 2078,
      "timestamp_start": "01:18:02,910",
      "timestamp_end": "01:18:03,590",
      "text": "always did."
    },
    {
      "moment_id": 149,
      "subtitle_id": 2092,
      "timestamp_start": "01:18:34,550",
      "timestamp_end": "01:18:35,410",
      "text": "They didn't need to."
    },
    {
      "moment_id": 150,
      "subtitle_id": 2106,
      "timestamp_start": "01:19:05,430",
      "timestamp_end": "01:19:08,230",
      "text": "refusing to look away, was sometimes the most"
    }
  ]
}